    "fatGrams": 52.6
  },
  "ingredients": [
    "1 3/4 cup shredded mozzarella",
    "1 ounce cream cheese",
    "3/4 cup almond flour",
    "1 large egg",
    "8 large beef hot dogs"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit. In a mixing bowl add the cream cheese, almond flour, and mozzarella cheese. Microwave on high for about 30 seconds.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crescent-dogs/#wprm-recipe-52487-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/keto-crescent-dogs-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the large egg then mix everything. I like to use a silicone spatula because it doesn’t stick to the dough.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crescent-dogs/#wprm-recipe-52487-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/keto-crescent-dogs-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix the dough thoroughly while still hot to the touch so that everything is incorporated and no lumps of almond flour or cheese remain.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crescent-dogs/#wprm-recipe-52487-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the dough on a piece of parchment or wax paper. If the dough is acting a bit “wet” then I prefer to use wax paper. Place a second piece of paper on the top then roll it out into a rough rectangle shape. (Or a perfect rectangle shape if you’re exceptionally talented.)",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crescent-dogs/#wprm-recipe-52487-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/keto-crescent-dogs-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut the dough into 8 strips using a knife or a pizza wheel.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crescent-dogs/#wprm-recipe-52487-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/keto-crescent-dogs-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully wrap the strips around the hot dogs. Sometimes the strips break on me. Don’t worry, just press the dough back together. Some of the dogs might look a little lumpy if this happens but that’s OK.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crescent-dogs/#wprm-recipe-52487-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/keto-crescent-dogs-09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for about 20-30 minutes or until golden brown. You can pop this under the broiler for the last few minutes to get a nice color on top.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crescent-dogs/#wprm-recipe-52487-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
